[* 
os.rdn
Copyright (c) 2023-2026 Ray Den
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

Purpose:
Cross-platform process and runtime helpers over the native syscall module.

Loading behavior:
This module chooses the shared-library suffix from __sharedlib_ext and loads:
../nativelibs/syscall(.so|.dylib|.dll)

Exports:
- pid   : -> current process id
- env   : variable-name -> string | null
- sleep : milliseconds -> true
- now   : -> current Unix epoch time in seconds

Examples:
"./libs/os.rdn" load
pid call print
"\n" print
"PATH" env call type print
"\n" print
0 sleep call pop
now call print
*]

"../nativelibs/syscall" __sharedlib_ext to_string swap pop append loadnative

env defun
    getEnv call
end

sleep defun
    sleepMs call
end

now defun
    epochTime call
end
